<title>JAPAN: Toei Chemical -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toei Chemical -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.75		vs	    1.61</p>
<p> Operating	   67    million    vs	   33    million</p>
<p> Current	     83    million    vs	   47    million</p>
<p> Net		   47    million    vs	    5    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.80 yen	  vs	    0.51 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toei Chemical Industry Co Ltd is involved in the development of movie film and video.</p>
</text>
